      "description": "Emergency Medicine Physician job at UT Southwestern Medical Center, Dallas, TX Emergency Medicine Physician job at UT Southwestern Medical Center, Dallas, TX Skip to main content Sitemap Hide Menu Why Work Here Military & Veterans Culture & Values Locations Life in Dallas Texas Behavioral Health Center Departments Advanced Practice Providers Adult Pediatrics Allied Health Faculty Imaging Services Information Technology Nursing Pharmacy Professional Services Research Postdoctoral Training Program Residencies & Fellowships Benefits Job Search Join Talent Community Log In Talent Community Sign In Current Employees Previous Applicants Open Menu Why Work Here Military & Veterans Culture & Values Locations Life in Dallas Texas Behavioral Health Center Departments Advanced Practice Providers Adult Pediatrics Allied Health Faculty Imaging Services Information Technology Nursing Pharmacy Professional Services Research Postdoctoral Training Program Residencies & Fellowships Benefits Job Search Join Talent Community Log In Talent Community Sign In Current Employees Previous Applicants 190312 Emergency Medicine Physician Location: Dallas , TX Location Type: Job Number: 961974 Category: Faculty and Physicians Posted 30+ Days Ago 23645345 Responsibilities Benefits Working at UTSW Responsibilities The University of Texas Southwestern Medical Center, Department of Emergency Medicine, is currently recruiting for a faculty member at the Assistant Professor level. The three-year Emergency Medicine residency program gives faculty the opportunity to work in a productive teaching and learning environment.  Opportunities for subspecialty activities and research are encouraged as we oversee several federally designated centers of excellence.  For those wanting to expand their EM training, we offer fellowships in Toxicology, Disaster Medicine, EMS, Pediatric Emergency Medicine, and Emergency Ultrasound. UT Southwestern Medical Center ranks among the top academic medica