nce your career. Navigation Home Why Work Here Locations Life in Dallas Benefits Job Search Results Sitemap Departments Advanced Practice Providers Allied Health Faculty Imaging Services Information Technology Nursing Pharmacy Professional Services Research Residencies & Fellowships Quick Links Patient Care Research Education & Training Newsroom About Us UTSW Corporate Home Address 6001 Forest Park Road Suite NG3.111 Dallas, Texas 75235 Phone 214-648-9810 Annual Security Report (ASR) This position is security-sensitive and subject to Texas Education Code 51.215, which authorizes UT Southwestern to obtain criminal history record information. UT Southwestern Medical Center is committed to an educational and working environment that provides equal opportunity to all members of the University community. As an equal opportunity employer, UT Southwestern prohibits unlawful discrimination, including discrimination on the basis of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, disability, genetic information, citizenship status, or veteran status. © 2024 UT Southwestern Medical Center | All Rights Reserved Opens in a new window Patient Rights Open Records Privacy Policy Site Policies - powered by Enfold-Hodes-Accessible WordPress Theme We use cookies to improve and personalize your experience and to analyze website performance and traffic. Please see our Cookie Policy for a description of how we use cookies or to manage your settings. Accept Scroll to top"
